<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Hail pocks and the holes northern flickers drill are two kinds of sudden damage a Calgary stucco wall can take. Sandstone Stucco Co is an advertising service that puts Calgary homeowners in touch with independent stucco contractors, who inspect the wall, write the scope and quote you directly. This page explains how each type of damage is assessed and repaired.</p><p>The two problems are handled differently. Hail is usually an insurance question first and a repair question second, so photos and a contractor's written scope matter. Flicker holes are a repair-plus-deterrence job with a federal bird-protection rule attached. This page is an advertisement: Sandstone Stucco Co is paid by contractors, and the contractor who quotes your job holds the contract, not this site. For general repairs, see <a href="/stucco-repair-calgary/">stucco repair in Calgary</a>.</p></div></div></section>
